{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1354673484, "parentid": 1354552174, "user": "Aunger67", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T18:42:20Z", "comment": "Listed MULTIPLE times as a progressive throughout the article. Editor also seems to either be leaving out the fact (or just unaware) of how there's no WP sidebar for the [[Democratic Party (United States)]]...which is why we don't have it listed here. BUT--must be known that the 2 parties in the U.S. contain MANY (often conflicting) ideologies (even intraparty). Emphasizing the ideology is more informative than just \"party\" (which tells almost nothing) [[Special:Diff/1354512124|1354512124]]", "tags": ["mw-undo", "mw-reverted", "wikieditor"], "size": 145705}
