{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1318807570, "parentid": 1318807191, "user": "Renamed user c0af5c6d5769c6d5a58e1b9188e21cc2", "timestamp": "2025-10-26T03:22:32Z", "comment": "disruptive edit Undid revision [[Special:Diff/1318807191|1318807191]] by [[Special:Contributions/RakowskiC|RakowskiC]] ([[User talk:RakowskiC|talk]])", "tags": ["mw-undo", "wikieditor"], "size": 106294}
{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1318807191, "parentid": 1318806774, "user": "RakowskiC", "timestamp": "2025-10-26T03:18:57Z", "comment": "This is a fair compromise until the dispute is settled. It is entirely misleading to include dual citizenship for some politicians but not for others.", "tags": ["mobile edit", "mobile web edit", "visualeditor", "mw-reverted"], "size": 106284}
{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1318806774, "parentid": 1318806477, "user": "Muboshgu", "timestamp": "2025-10-26T03:15:06Z", "comment": "Undid revision [[Special:Diff/1318806477|1318806477]] by [[Special:Contributions/RakowskiC|RakowskiC]] ([[User talk:RakowskiC|talk]]) Schwarzenegger was Mr. Universe as an Austrian, Mamdani isn't notable for being Ugandan. Stop edit warring and use the talk page.", "tags": ["mw-undo", "wikieditor"], "size": 106294}
{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1318806477, "parentid": 1318805635, "user": "RakowskiC", "timestamp": "2025-10-26T03:12:19Z", "comment": "Citizenship is relevant. Citizenship is always relevant in politics. [[WP:CONTEXTBIO]] uses Arnold Schwarzenegger as an example who is Austrian and became governor of California. I made it more clear in this phrasing by including “an” American politician. If you revert this change which I made a fair compromise on, I will report for editing warring.", "tags": ["mobile edit", "mobile web edit", "visualeditor", "mw-reverted"], "size": 106308}
{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1318805635, "parentid": 1318803646, "user": "Renamed user c0af5c6d5769c6d5a58e1b9188e21cc2", "timestamp": "2025-10-26T03:05:39Z", "comment": ". Similarly, neither previous nationalities nor the country of birth should be mentioned in the opening paragraph unless relevant to the subject's notability. Undid revision [[Special:Diff/1318803646|1318803646]] by [[Special:Contributions/RakowskiC|RakowskiC]] ([[User talk:RakowskiC|talk]])", "tags": ["mw-undo", "wikieditor"], "size": 106294}
{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1318803646, "parentid": 1318788418, "user": "RakowskiC", "timestamp": "2025-10-26T02:49:40Z", "comment": "Included Ugandan citizenship in opening as he is politician with dual citizenship. He is a naturalized US citizen and a natural born citizen of Uganda. This is standard as per [[WP:CONTEXTBIO]]", "tags": ["visualeditor", "mw-reverted"], "size": 106305}
{"rank": 131, "article": "Zohran Mamdani", "revid": 1318788418, "parentid": 1318787049, "user": "Renamed user c0af5c6d5769c6d5a58e1b9188e21cc2", "timestamp": "2025-10-26T00:47:49Z", "comment": "Source has no mention of Iran. Please be more careful Undid revision [[Special:Diff/1318786952|1318786952]] by [[Special:Contributions/SeldomSeldom|SeldomSeldom]] ([[User talk:SeldomSeldom|talk]])", "tags": ["mw-undo", "wikieditor"], "size": 106294}
